    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1684861555\" /></div><br><br>During a vegetable contest in the Middle Ages, one of the participants tried to cheat by casting a spell to make their vegetables bigger. It fails and ends up bringing the vegetables to life. Due to this situation, the villagers call Megi, a powerful little traveling witch with magic powers in order to protect their hoses and finish with the vegetable\u2019s invasion. <br><br>To do this, Megi will need to go through the outside of the village into the main castle trying to find the invasion\u2019s origin and defeat the vegetables that are haunting the villagers, bringing everything back to normal.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1684861555\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Cartoony medieval and fantasy-themed 2D run-and-gun platformer<br></li><li> Play cooperatively with the supported 2-player Local coop mode<br></li><li> Featured abilities: fast speed, quick-dash ability, and powerful magic projectiles!<br></li><li> Languages: English, Spanish, Finish, Polish, Catalan, Basque</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/5e0563314beb064e16a12a98d98c3c2f.poster.avif?t=1684861555\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/5e0563314beb064e16a12a98d98c3c2f.webm?t=1684861555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/5e0563314beb064e16a12a98d98c3c2f.mp4?t=1684861555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/be67dd0a022ee0215b8e52c0afc257c3.poster.avif?t=1684861555\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/be67dd0a022ee0215b8e52c0afc257c3.webm?t=1684861555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/be67dd0a022ee0215b8e52c0afc257c3.mp4?t=1684861555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/eda035fab55dc2e5bea4da4051c84b41.poster.avif?t=1684861555\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/eda035fab55dc2e5bea4da4051c84b41.webm?t=1684861555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/eda035fab55dc2e5bea4da4051c84b41.mp4?t=1684861555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1684861555\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018490/extras/36dba6a99dbb13d01cd01afb3296b0d0.avif?t=1684861555\" /></div><br><br>Veggie Menace is a project developed by Pigment Krew, a team of 2nd Year students at DigiPen Institute of Technology Europe - Bilbao in a 9-month development cycle from the ground up using C++ to develop their engine and game.",
